// A library with nodes (A9): main.sgl imports it `as: aws`, so its classes
// are `aws.Lambda`, its variables `$aws.orange`, and its nodes and edge are
// grafted under a container `aws`; nodes-without-as.sgl imports it without
// `as` (SGL2026).
@title: "AWS"
@vars: { orange: "#FF9900" }
@classes: { Lambda: { @shape: hexagon, @style.fill: $orange } }
lambda: { @type: Lambda, @label: "Lambda" }
queue: { @label: "SQS" }
lambda -> queue
